Z||000000||NEFA||06-04-2001||06:20 PM||||Thanks Cliff, This is great.<P>  We now are taking orders for New England Fiero Association T-Shirts, If you would like to show your Club support please click the link under the Sig to get ordering info.<P>  There will be a Pontiac Show at the Bud Brewery in Merrimack, NH on June 10th. There will be 2 Fiero classes. Notch-back and Fast back. I will post more info about this event later in the week as it comes to me. <P>If anyone has or would like to write an article to support the Pride Newsletter Please send them to me. You can write about anything Fiero related. We always need your help in this task. Thanks.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fieropride.com/logos/NEFA_Logo12_small.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/calendar.htm" TARGET=_blank>Upcoming Club Events</A> <P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/jaygee79/tshirt.html" TARGET=_blank>Get your Club T-shirt</A><P>Fixed T-shirt URL<p>[This message has been edited by NEFA (edited 06-05-2001).]||||reg||7
